      "content": "i used to feel like there was someone watching over me, you know? like everything happened for a reason. but lately i just feel... nothing. it feels like i've been staring into this giant, freezing black hole for weeks and i realize there's actually nothing there. no god, no purpose, just empty space. it's terrifying. i don't even know why i'm bothering to wake up anymore if it's all just nothingness.",
